// Purpose:
// 未使用 declaration の構造受理・recursive Self projection・forward refs
// Based on tests (source-visible behavior; host/internal assertions remain unit tests):
// tests/test_concrete_identity_positions.py::test_concrete_and_open_world_targets_remain_valid
// tests/test_failure_contract.py::test_recursion_uses_signatures
// tests/test_failure_contract.py::test_upper_bounds
// tests/test_guarantee_method_signature.py::test_absent_method_and_multiple_requirements_unchanged
// tests/test_guarantee_method_signature.py::test_recursive_projection_and_normalization
